(40649,72980,'F122',NULL,'<p>According to the <a href=\"https://lis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?241+oth+SB28F122+PDF\">fiscal impact statement</a>, there is no anticipated state fiscal impact resulting from the provisions of this bill. Any impact to local school divisions is indeterminate.</p>\n        <p class=\"openai\">Summary generated automatically by OpenAI.</p>','2025-01-12 03:10:40','2025-01-12 03:10:40');
