(40617,72932,'F122',NULL,'<p>The <a href=\"https://lis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?241+oth+HB67F122+PDF\">fiscal impact statement</a> estimates that the potential revenue loss due to the implementation of this legislation could range from $289,755 in FY 2025 to $326,311 by FY 2030.</p>\n        <p class=\"openai\">Summary generated automatically by OpenAI.</p>','2025-01-12 03:10:40','2025-01-12 03:10:40');
